desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "Struct scan: Python telnetlib"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python telnetlib"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-python-telnetlib"
	risk: "cleartext-transmission"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 telnetlib。Telnet 明文传输凭据。

### 风险类型
cleartext-transmission

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
改用 SSH，并校验主机密钥。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://t.py": <<<POS
import telnetlib
def c(h):
    return telnetlib.Telnet(h)

POS
	"safefile://s.py": <<<NEG
def c(h):
    return h

NEG
)

telnetlib.Telnet as $call
telnetlib.Telnet(* as $h) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Python telnetlib",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python telnetlib",
	message: "结构扫描：Python telnetlib",
	risk: "cleartext-transmission",
}
